        ❓ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) - CISCE Board Class 10th & 12th Result 2026


            When will the CISCE ICSE & ISC Result 2026 be declared?
                The results are officially declared on 30th April 2026 at 11:00 AM IST.

            How can I check my CISCE Class 10th or 12th Result 2026?
                Visit results.cisce.org, enter your Course Code, Unique ID, Index Number, and Captcha.

            What details are required to download the result?
                You need: Course Code (ICSE/ISC), Unique ID (UID), Index Number, and Captcha code.

            I forgot my Unique ID / Index Number. What should I do?
                Contact your school immediately. They can provide your Unique ID and Index Number.

            Can I download the digital marksheet?
                Yes, the online result acts as a provisional marksheet. You can download and print it for reference.

            When will the original marksheets and certificates be issued?
                Original documents will be distributed through your respective schools within 2–3 weeks after result declaration.

            What is the procedure for re-checking or re-evaluation?
                The re-checking window usually opens 7–10 days after result declaration. Apply through your school only.

            Is the result available on mobile or SMS?
                No official SMS service. Results can be checked only through the official website on mobile or desktop.



            Note: Always use the official CISCE websites only. Beware of fake websites and SMS claiming to provide early results.

























 







